@prefix : <http://example.org/orexis/world/loner#> .
@prefix sensing: <http://example.org/orexis/sensing#> .
@prefix water: <http://example.org/orexis/water#> .
@prefix desire: <http://example.org/orexis/desire#> .
@prefix intention: <http://example.org/orexis/intention#> .
@prefix actuation: <http://example.org/orexis/actuation#> .
@prefix reporting: <http://example.org/orexis/reporting#> .
@prefix ssn:  <http://www.w3.org/ns/ssn/> .
@prefix schema: <https://schema.org/> .
@prefix ag:   <http://example.org/orexis#> .

#  The gardener's PRIVATE beliefs. No market blocks at all — it buys nothing and sells
#  nothing, which is what this world exists to show: an agent can want, watch, decide,
#  commit and act with no economy anywhere, and every rung it uses is the same machinery
#  the market worlds run.

##  sensing:Subscribing — the interval it asks its probe to keep — and, since the butt got
#   its witness, sensing:Listening's one term beside it: how long the announcing clock may
#   go quiet before the level is called gone. The grace serves both clocks.
:gardener
    sensing:fastSleepS 30 ;
    sensing:slowSleepS 600 ;
    sensing:readingGraceS 45 ;
    sensing:maxReadingAgeS 300 .

##  desire — the pick inside the region the SPECIES states (operating 0.10..0.30).
#   0.18: dry-side of centre, deliberately — the survival ceiling is a rot cliff and the
#   floor is nearly free, so a ZZ keeper errs dry. The region arrives entailed; only this
#   pick is the gardener's.
:gardener ag:aims [ ssn:forProperty water:SoilMoisture ; schema:value 0.18 ] .

##  water — what it believes its pot takes: the conversion a self-dose is sized with.
#   The physics copy lives on the pot in the world; this is the agent's own, the one it
#   would revise if it learned the pot drains oddly — same split as every bidder's.
:gardener water:litresPerFraction 1.5 .

##  intention — the patience that stands between a reflex and a rotted rhizome: ten
#   minutes, several cadences long, because a second impulse to water the same plant
#   inside it is the same impulse.
:gardener ag:patienceS 600 .

##  actuation — slack past a dose's own open-seconds before silence is counted.
:gardener actuation:doseGraceS 10 .

##  reporting
:gardener reporting:metricsIntervalS 60 .
